  "title": "Charter to Hold Webcast to Discuss First Quarter 2026 Financial and Operating Results",
  "summary": "STAMFORD, Conn., March 11, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Charter Communications, Inc. (NASDAQ: CHTR) (the \"Company\" or \"Charter\") will host a webcast on Friday, April 24, 2026 at 8:30 a.m. Eastern Time (ET) to discuss financial and operating results for the quarter ended March 31, 2026.",
